  "url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/product/graffiti-four-music-symbols/",
  "description": "Immerse yourself in the urban atmosphere with these four dynamic Graffiti Music Symbols. Crafted in EPS 10 SVG jpeg format, these designs are the epitome of street-inspired creativity. Perfect for transforming your personal projects into masterpieces, these Graffiti symbols make magnificent wall art, mind-blowing posters and quirky t-shirts!\nWith a raw, hand-drawn aesthetic they also excellently represent rebellious side of street art on stickers or decorations. Dressed in splashes of grungy colors and encrusted with the texture of spray paints, these artworks ooze rough charm. Every brushstroke, ink splash, and dripping detail ingeniously mimics the unpredictability and messiness of traditional graffiti.\nBeyond the visual charm, these graphics embody vibrant interaction, friendship, and teamwork. Just like a human gesture packed with emotion or a heartening high-five shared between friends, these designs instill a sense of camaraderie and success. Brighten up any space with these high-energy graphics, blending the appeal of street art with the simplicity of modern design. Whether you’re seeking to entertain, inspire or simply add a touch of beauty, these graffiti music symbols are instrumental in setting the right tone.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Immerse yourself in the urban atmosphere with these four dynamic Graffiti Music Symbols. Crafted in EPS 10 SVG jpeg format, these designs are the epitome of street-inspired creativity. Perfect for transforming your personal projects into masterpieces, these Graffiti symbols make magnificent wall art, mind-blowing posters and quirky t-shirts!</p>\n<p>With a raw, hand-drawn aesthetic they also excellently represent rebellious side of street art on stickers or decorations. Dressed in splashes of grungy colors and encrusted with the texture of spray paints, these artworks ooze rough charm. Every brushstroke, ink splash, and dripping detail ingeniously mimics the unpredictability and messiness of traditional graffiti.</p>\n<p>Beyond the visual charm, these graphics embody vibrant interaction, friendship, and teamwork. Just like a human gesture packed with emotion or a heartening high-five shared between friends, these designs instill a sense of camaraderie and success. Brighten up any space with these high-energy graphics, blending the appeal of street art with the simplicity of modern design. Whether you’re seeking to entertain, inspire or simply add a touch of beauty, these graffiti music symbols are instrumental in setting the right tone.</p>",
